From: gts7l project
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: cs35l41: give the protection firmware time to answer
 mailbox commands

cs35l41_set_cspl_mbox_cmd() polled the firmware's mailbox status for 5 ms.
On the Galaxy Tab S7 (Cirrus protection firmware 400a4 v0.0.1) that is
too short. Measured over back-to-back streams:
- RESUME took 27-31 ms when a stream started within the 3 s autosuspend
  window, before the amp hibernated;
- PAUSE took 5-6 ms.
RESUME therefore failed every time ("Failed to set mailbox cmd 2 (status
1)", DSP1 POST_PMU -42). The firmware stayed PAUSED, so the stream played
silence. PAUSE failed now and then as well. Until now the workaround was
autosuspend_delay_ms = 0, so that every stream started from hibernation.

Poll for up to 100 ms. OUT_OF_HIBERNATE keeps 5 polls, since
cs35l41_exit_hibernate() already retries it 20 x 5 times.

--- a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41-lib.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41-lib.c
@@ -1455,7 +1455,7 @@
 int cs35l41_set_cspl_mbox_cmd(struct device *dev, struct regmap *regmap,
 			      enum cs35l41_cspl_mbox_cmd cmd)
 {
-	unsigned int sts = 0, i;
+	unsigned int sts = 0, i, max_polls;
 	int ret;
 
 	// Set mailbox cmd
@@ -1467,7 +1467,14 @@
 	}
 
 	// Read mailbox status and verify it is appropriate for the given cmd
-	for (i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
+	/*
+	 * The protection firmware can take ~30 ms to act on RESUME when the
+	 * previous stream ended only just before (seen on the Galaxy Tab S7),
+	 * and ~6 ms for PAUSE; 5 ms was not enough. Allow up to 100 ms, except
+	 * for OUT_OF_HIBERNATE, whose caller retries it in its own loop.
+	 */
+	max_polls = cmd == CSPL_MBOX_CMD_OUT_OF_HIBERNATE ? 5 : 100;
+	for (i = 0; i < max_polls; i++) {
 		usleep_range(1000, 1100);
 
 		ret = regmap_read(regmap, CS35L41_DSP_MBOX_2, &sts);
@@ -1481,10 +1488,12 @@
 			return -EINVAL;
 		}
 
-		if (!cs35l41_check_cspl_mbox_sts(cmd, sts))
+		if (!cs35l41_check_cspl_mbox_sts(cmd, sts)) {
 			dev_dbg(dev, "[%u] cmd %u returned invalid sts %u", i, cmd, sts);
-		else
+		} else {
+			dev_dbg(dev, "mailbox cmd %u done after %u polls\n", cmd, i + 1);
 			return 0;
+		}
 	}
 
 	if (cmd != CSPL_MBOX_CMD_OUT_OF_HIBERNATE)
